---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who is behind CampCrackle and how gear gets picked.">
  <article>
    <h1>About CampCrackle</h1>
    <p>Hi, I'm Gus. I camp out of a midsize pickup, sleeping in the truck bed and cooking off the tailgate.</p>
    <p>CampCrackle is where I share the setups and gear that actually work for truck camping, and the things I'd skip. The goal is simple: help you sleep better, eat better and spend less time setting up camp.</p>
    <h2>How I pick gear</h2>
    <p>I recommend products based on my own use, long-term reviews from other campers and how well they fit a truck bed. I never accept payment to include a product.</p>
    <h2>How this site makes money</h2>
    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. That commission comes from the store, not from you, and it doesn't change the price you pay.</p>
    <p>Questions or suggestions? Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
